```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Armed : producer emits Alarm at finish time
    Armed --> Ringing : alarm fires and the service starts

    Ringing --> Ringing : reschedule whose list still holds the expired Alarm
    Ringing --> Idle : new interval or alarm mode off
    Ringing --> Snoozed : Snooze tapped on notification or alarm screen
    Ringing --> Recreated : reschedule that stops the service

    Recreated --> Ringing : next reschedule arms it and fires again

    Snoozed --> Ringing : snooze deadline reached
    Snoozed --> Idle : new interval or timer extended

    note right of Ringing : alarm screen shown only when locked or screen off
    note right of Recreated : audio released then restarted and the task is cleared
```
